# Montarro environment variables (set in Vercel Project Settings → Environment
# Variables). VITE_ vars are readable in the browser.

# GoHighLevel calendar embed URL shown after the form is submitted, e.g.
# https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/<calendarId>
# If unset, the booking step degrades gracefully to a "we'll reach out" message.
VITE_GHL_CALENDAR_URL=

# GoHighLevel Private Integration Token — SERVER-ONLY (deliberately not
# VITE_-prefixed; Vite would inline a VITE_ var into the client bundle).
# Read exclusively by src/server/lead.ts, which POSTs the /contact
# strategy-call form straight to GHL's /contacts/upsert API. Never expose
# this to the browser.
GHL_PIT=
